  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jawed Haji Harun Mohammad vs State Of Mah. Thr. Pso, Murtizapur ... on 16 November, 2021 Author: Vinay Joshi Bench: V. G. Joshi Order 1611aba 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Nagpur Bench : Nagpur. Criminal Application [Aba] No. 771/2021. Jawed Haji Harun Mohammad -Versus- State of Maharashtra, through Murtizapur Police Station, Akola.",
    "facts": "In anticipation of arrest in connection with Crime No.435/2021 registered with Murtizapur Police Station, District Akola for the offence punishable under Sections 328, 272 and 273 of the Indian Penal Code read with Sections 26 and 59 of the Food Safety and Standard Act, the applicant is seeking pre-arrest protection. 3. It is submitted that the applicant is no way concerned with the alleged seizure in any manner. Prima facie it reveals that huge quantity of contraband article - Gutka was seized from three persons, who disclosed that it belonged to one Mr. Agrawal. Name of the applicant is not mentioned in the first information report.",
